Package: CCIcompass
Title: Composite Interaction Score for Cell-Cell Interaction Prioritization
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Olha", "Kholod",
           email = "olha.kholod@dartmouth.edu",
           role  = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6257-4948"))
Description: Prioritizes and ranks cell-cell interactions (CCIs) from
    single-cell RNA-seq data using the Composite Interaction Score (CIS),
    an ensemble metric based on Rank-Biased Precision (RBP). The package
    wraps the LIANA framework to run six CCI inference methods, applies
    donor-aware filtering, and aggregates results into a single ranked
    output from a Seurat object in one function call.
